{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y的音乐细节描写和随具体乐句出现的细微变化明显不如X丰富，部分音乐情绪的层次被压缩了。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的叙述更连贯自然，人物每一步为什么产生新的念头、为什么犹豫、为什么改变，都交代得比较清楚，左右分区也让故事和感受容易分别扫读。X的加亮词更有利于迅速抓住段落重点，音乐细节和情绪变化也更丰富，但感受意象有时过密、重复，容易让注意力从人物正在经历的事情上移开。总体而言，Y更容易让普通观众一边听音乐一边理解并跟住这段关系的发展，X则在音乐感受的细腻程度上有明显优势。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8413ac2a-0fa1-48b0-afaf-6375b8ed5625", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T070757550841Z", "elapsed_seconds": 135.156, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T07:10:12.712401+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "64d9819907f43be0f13494666ac65bd8166efd64a0569d7945d966d6e01a183a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3